  "reproduction": "Install the recorded toolchain, PowerShell 7, Playwright and Edge. Copy one command JSON to a new private output directory, replace the two path placeholders with absolute paths, set CRONY_PLAYWRIGHT_MODULE to the installed Playwright module and CARGO_TARGET_DIR to an isolated source-bound build directory, and invoke node live-command-capture.mjs <configuration.json>. The stagedTree must match git write-tree. Use a fresh native crony-mcp binary via CRONY_MCP_TEST_BINARY for the Node gate. Each execution writes raw output, a source/exit receipt and running/completed PNGs. Original/private configurations remain separately hashed."
